ex20v-openwrt-tool-macos
=========================

This project is a macOS port of the Windows PowerShell tool:

    tplink_ex20v_openwrt_tool
    https://github.com/yucellmustafa/tplink_ex20v_openwrt_tool
    (c) yucellmustafa and contributors

